      "html": "      <p>Three things go wrong, and each has a tell in the thread.</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>The loop doesn&#x27;t finish.</strong> Review after review, nothing passes. The checks are vague, so nothing can meet them. Tighten them: each check should be something anyone could verify.</li>\n        <li><strong>The PM approves everything.</strong> Reviews say &quot;looks good&quot; without saying why. The brief needs to ask for evidence: a test that runs, a screenshot, the command&#x27;s output.</li>\n        <li><strong>The coder drifts.</strong> It&#x27;s busy with something the checks don&#x27;t mention. Point the PM back at its own list, and ask it to hold the coder to it.</li>\n      </ul>"
